<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN PGA CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN PGA CHAMPIONSHIP SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from the</p>
<p>second round of the 2.15 million rand (480,000 dollar) South</p>
<p>African PGA Championship at par 72 Houghton Golf Club on Friday</p>
<p>(South African unless stated).</p>
<p>131 Retief Goosen 65 66</p>
<p>132 David Frost 69 63, Thomas Gogele (Germany) 64 68</p>
<p>133 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 67 66, Massimo Scarpa (Italy) 65 68</p>
<p>134 Wayne Westner 68 66, Van Phillips (Britain) 70 64,</p>
<p>Katsuyoshi Tomori (Japan) 67 67, Gary Emerson (Britain) 67 67,</p>
<p>Bob May (U.S.) 66 68</p>
<p>135 Mark Murless 66 69, Niclas Fasth (Sweden) 66 69, Paul</p>
<p>Lawrie (Britain) 69 66, Max Anglert (Sweden) 68 67, Clinton</p>
<p>Whitelaw 68 67</p>
<p>136 Michael Archer (Britain) 68 68, Craig Kamps 68 68, Nico van</p>
<p>Rensburg 68 68</p>
<p>137 Malcolm McKenzie (Britain) 69 68, Ashley Roestoff 67 70,</p>
<p>Gary Clark (Britain) 68 69, Hugh Baiocchi 69 68, Alan McLean 66</p>
<p>71, Marco Gortana 70 67, Des Terblanche 69 68, Gordon Sherry</p>
<p>(Britain) 69 68, Brad Ott (U.S.) 68 69, John Nelson 66 71.</p>
</text>
